{
  "id": "LEV.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "LEV",
  "reference": "Leviticus 11",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Lord gave Moses and Aaron the following regulations ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for the people of Israel. You may eat any land animal ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that has divided hoofs and that also chews the cud, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but you must not eat camels, rock-badgers, or rabbits. They must be considered unclean; they chew the cud, but do not have divided hoofs. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.4+LEV.11.5+LEV.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.4",
              "LEV.11.5",
              "LEV.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not eat pigs. They must be considered unclean; they have divided hoofs, but do not chew the cud. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not eat these animals or even touch their dead bodies; they are unclean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You may eat any kind of fish that has fins and scales, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but anything living in the water that does not have fins and scales must not be eaten. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Such creatures must be considered unclean. You must not eat them or even touch their dead bodies. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You must not eat anything that lives in the water and does not have fins and scales.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You must not eat any of the following birds: eagles, owls, hawks, falcons; buzzards, vultures, crows; ostriches; seagulls, storks, herons, pelicans, cormorants;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.13+LEV.11.14+LEV.11.15+LEV.11.16+LEV.11.17+LEV.11.18+LEV.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.13",
              "LEV.11.14",
              "LEV.11.15",
              "LEV.11.16",
              "LEV.11.17",
              "LEV.11.18",
              "LEV.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11.13–19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "The identification of some of the birds in verses 13–19 is uncertain.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " hoopoes; or bats.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.13+LEV.11.14+LEV.11.15+LEV.11.16+LEV.11.17+LEV.11.18+LEV.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.13",
              "LEV.11.14",
              "LEV.11.15",
              "LEV.11.16",
              "LEV.11.17",
              "LEV.11.18",
              "LEV.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.13+LEV.11.14+LEV.11.15+LEV.11.16+LEV.11.17+LEV.11.18+LEV.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.13",
              "LEV.11.14",
              "LEV.11.15",
              "LEV.11.16",
              "LEV.11.17",
              "LEV.11.18",
              "LEV.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All winged insects are unclean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "except those that hop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You may eat locusts, crickets, or grasshoppers. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But all other small things that have wings and also crawl must be considered unclean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whoever touches the dead bodies of the following animals will be unclean until evening: all animals with hoofs, unless their hoofs are divided and they chew the cud, and all four-footed animals with paws. Whoever carries their dead bodies must wash his clothes, but he will still be unclean until evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.24+LEV.11.25+LEV.11.26+LEV.11.27+LEV.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.24",
              "LEV.11.25",
              "LEV.11.26",
              "LEV.11.27",
              "LEV.11.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.24+LEV.11.25+LEV.11.26+LEV.11.27+LEV.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.24",
              "LEV.11.25",
              "LEV.11.26",
              "LEV.11.27",
              "LEV.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moles, rats, mice, and lizards must be considered unclean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.29+LEV.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.29",
              "LEV.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whoever touches them or their dead bodies will be unclean until evening. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if their dead bodies fall on anything, it will be unclean. This applies to any article of wood, cloth, leather, or sacking, no matter what it is used for. It shall be dipped in water, but it will remain unclean until evening. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if their bodies fall into a clay pot, everything that is in it shall be unclean, and you must break the pot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Any food which could normally be eaten, but on which water from such a pot has been poured, will be unclean, and anything drinkable in such a pot is unclean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anything on which the dead bodies fall is unclean; a clay stove or oven shall be broken, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but a spring or a cistern remains clean, although anything else that touches their dead bodies is unclean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If one of them falls on seed that is going to be sown, the seed remains clean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if the seed is soaking in water and one of them falls on it, the seed is unclean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If any animal that may be eaten dies, anyone who touches it will be unclean until evening. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if anyone eats any part of the animal, he must wash his clothes, but he will still be unclean until evening; anyone who carries the dead body must wash his clothes, but he will still be unclean until evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You must not eat any of the small animals that move on the ground, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
