          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This, then, is the law about animals and birds, about everything that lives in the water, and everything that moves on the ground. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
